    "change": "One six-line constructor-new quiet NINT UnaryPlus operand, one three-line old-None FULL fallback and scope comment.",
    "compatibility": "Constructor-new typed PLUS authenticates root/proper child and reuses quiet COERCED(NINT i)false +long_range to return PINT i; no old typed PLUS clause overlapped. Dedicated FULL fallback requires old-byte=None, preserving every old Some byte result. Every new cycle descends proper child; all other typed/byte/helper branches and shared trees/SHORT/non-NUL/truth/receipt46/cache/owner bodies/UnaryMinus remain literal.",
    "preserved": "All old operand and FULL helper branches, shared byte trees, SHORT/non-NUL/truth rules, receipt/46 guards, caches and owner/lifetime bodies remain literal; no runtime carrier or native evaluation fallback."
  },
